{"seq":2,"slug":"code-generation","title":"代码生成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/code-generation","wordCount":1378,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"代码生成\">代码生成</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>AI 代码生成是生成式 AI 对软件工程影响最直接的应用方向。从简单的代码补全到完整函数生成，从自然语言到代码的翻译到代码库级别的重构，AI 正在改变开发者编写代码的方式。代码生成模型的核心是在海量代码语料上预训练的大型语言模型，结合代码理解和推理能力来生成语法正确、语义准确且风格一致的代码。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[AI 代码生成] --&gt; B[代码补全]&#10;    A --&gt; C[自然语言到代码]&#10;    A --&gt; D[代码翻译]&#10;    A --&gt; E[代码审查与修复]&#10;    B --&gt; F[行级补全]&#10;    B --&gt; G[函数级补全]&#10;    C --&gt; H[需求到实现]&#10;    C --&gt; I[注释到代码]&#10;    D --&gt; J[语言间翻译]&#10;    E --&gt; K[Bug 检测]&#10;    E --&gt; L[自动修复]\">graph TD\n    A[AI 代码生成] --&gt; B[代码补全]\n    A --&gt; C[自然语言到代码]\n    A --&gt; D[代码翻译]\n    A --&gt; E[代码审查与修复]\n    B --&gt; F[行级补全]\n    B --&gt; G[函数级补全]\n    C --&gt; H[需求到实现]\n    C --&gt; I[注释到代码]\n    D --&gt; J[语言间翻译]\n    E --&gt; K[Bug 检测]\n    E --&gt; L[自动修复]</pre><p>代码生成与自然语言生成有本质区别：代码有严格的语法约束，必须能够编译和执行；代码有明确的功能性正确性标准，可以通过测试验证；代码的上下文依赖更为复杂，涉及类型系统、API 约定和项目级别的架构模式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模型</th>\n<th>开发者</th>\n<th>参数量</th>\n<th>训练数据</th>\n<th>核心能力</th>\n<th>开源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Codex</td>\n<td>OpenAI</td>\n<td>12B</td>\n<td>GitHub 代码</td>\n<td>代码生成</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CodeLlama</td>\n<td>Meta</td>\n<td>7-70B</td>\n<td>代码+文本</td>\n<td>补全+指令</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>StarCoder2</td>\n<td>BigCode</td>\n<td>3-15B</td>\n<td>The Stack v2</td>\n<td>多语言代码</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>DeepSeek-Coder</td>\n<td>DeepSeek</td>\n<td>1.3-33B</td>\n<td>代码+数学</td>\n<td>代码+推理</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Claude</td>\n<td>Anthropic</td>\n<td>未公开</td>\n<td>多模态</td>\n<td>代码+分析</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPT-4</td>\n<td>OpenAI</td>\n<td>未公开</td>\n<td>多模态</td>\n<td>通用+代码</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"代码补全与上下文理解\">代码补全与上下文理解</h2><p>代码补全是最基础也是使用频率最高的代码生成能力。现代代码补全系统不仅根据当前文件的上下文预测接下来的代码，还需要理解项目级别的依赖关系、API 约定和编码风格。GitHub Copilot 是这一领域的标杆产品，它基于 OpenAI Codex 模型在编辑器中提供实时补全建议。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from transformers import AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForCausalLM&#10;&#10;class CodeCompleter:&#10;    def __init__(self, model_name=&quot;bigcode/starcoder2-7b&quot;):&#10;        self.tokenizer = AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)&#10;        self.model = AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(&#10;            model_name, torch_dtype=torch.float16, device_map=&quot;auto&quot;&#10;        )&#10;&#10;    def complete(self, code_prefix, max_new_tokens=256, temperature=0.2):&#10;        inputs = self.tokenizer(code_prefix, return_tensors=&quot;pt&quot;).to(self.model.device)&#10;        with torch.no_grad():&#10;            outputs = self.model.generate(&#10;                **inputs,&#10;                max_new_tokens=max_new_tokens,&#10;                temperature=temperature,&#10;                top_p=0.95,&#10;                do_sample=True,&#10;                pad_token_id=self.tokenizer.eos_token_id,&#10;            )&#10;        generated = outputs[0][inputs[&quot;input_ids&quot;].shape[1]:]&#10;        return self.tokenizer.decode(generated, skip_special_tokens=True)&#10;&#10;    def fill_in_middle(self, prefix, suffix, max_new_tokens=128):&#10;        prompt = f&quot;&lt;fim_prefix&gt;{prefix}&lt;fim_suffix&gt;{suffix}&lt;fim_middle&gt;&quot;&#10;        inputs = self.tokenizer(prompt, return_tensors=&quot;pt&quot;).to(self.model.device)&#10;        with torch.no_grad():&#10;            outputs = self.model.generate(**inputs, max_new_tokens=max_new_tokens, temperature=0.2)&#10;        generated = outputs[0][inputs[&quot;input_ids&quot;].shape[1]:]&#10;        return self.tokenizer.decode(generated, skip_special_tokens=True)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> transformers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer, AutoModelForCausalLM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodeCompleter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, model_name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bigcode/starcoder2-7b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokenizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoTokenizer.from_pretrained(model_name)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AutoModelForCausalLM.from_pretrained(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            model_name, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">torch_dtype</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">torch.float16, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">device_map</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"auto\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> complete</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, code_prefix, max_new_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        inputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokenizer(code_prefix, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">return_tensors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).to(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.generate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                **</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputs,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                max_new_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">max_new_tokens,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">temperature,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                top_p</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.95</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                do_sample</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">                pad_token_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokenizer.eos_token_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        generated </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][inputs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokenizer.decode(generated, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">skip_special_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fill_in_middle</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, prefix, suffix, max_new_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"&#x3C;fim_prefix></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">prefix</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;fim_suffix></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">suffix</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">&#x3C;fim_middle>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        inputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokenizer(prompt, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">return_tensors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).to(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.no_grad():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            outputs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.model.generate(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">inputs, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_new_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">max_new_tokens, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">temperature</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        generated </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> outputs[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">][inputs[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"input_ids\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].shape[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tokenizer.decode(generated, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">skip_special_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Fill-in-the-Middle（FIM）是代码补全的关键训练策略。传统的自回归模型只能根据前缀预测后续内容，而 FIM 训练使模型能够根据前缀和后缀预测中间的代码。这对于实际编辑场景至关重要——开发者的光标通常位于已有代码的中间位置。StarCoder 和 CodeLlama 都支持 FIM 补全。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph 上下文层次&#10;        A[当前行] --&gt; B[当前函数]&#10;        B --&gt; C[当前文件]&#10;        C --&gt; D[相关文件]&#10;        D --&gt; E[项目结构]&#10;        E --&gt; F[API 文档]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph 上下文层次\n        A[当前行] --&gt; B[当前函数]\n        B --&gt; C[当前文件]\n        C --&gt; D[相关文件]\n        D --&gt; E[项目结构]\n        E --&gt; F[API 文档]\n    end</pre><p>上下文窗口的大小直接限制了代码补全的质量。早期模型的 2K-4K token 窗口只能看到当前文件的一部分，而现代模型的 128K+ 窗口可以包含多个相关文件的内容。Retrieval-Augmented Generation（RAG）进一步通过检索项目中的相关代码片段来增强上下文，使补全建议更符合项目的特定约定和模式。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码-agent-与自动化开发\">代码 Agent 与自动化开发</h2><p>代码 Agent 将代码生成从被动的补全升级为主动的任务执行。Agent 接收高层次的任务描述（如&quot;为这个 API 添加分页功能&quot;），自主规划实现步骤，编写代码，运行测试，修复错误，直到任务完成。这种模式将 AI 从&quot;编辑器插件&quot;升级为&quot;虚拟开发者&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class CodeAgent:&#10;    def __init__(self, llm, tools):&#10;        self.llm = llm&#10;        self.tools = tools&#10;&#10;    def plan(self, task_description, codebase_context):&#10;        prompt = f&quot;&quot;&quot;Task: {task_description}&#10;Context: {codebase_context}&#10;Create a step-by-step plan to implement this task.&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        return self.llm.generate(prompt)&#10;&#10;    def execute_step(self, step, current_code):&#10;        prompt = f&quot;&quot;&quot;Step: {step}&#10;Current code:&#10;{current_code}&#10;Write the code to implement this step.&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        new_code = self.llm.generate(prompt)&#10;        return new_code&#10;&#10;    def run_tests(self, code):&#10;        result = self.tools[&quot;test_runner&quot;].run(code)&#10;        return result&#10;&#10;    def fix_errors(self, code, error_message):&#10;        prompt = f&quot;&quot;&quot;Code:&#10;{code}&#10;Error:&#10;{error_message}&#10;Fix the error and return the corrected code.&quot;&quot;&quot;&#10;        return self.llm.generate(prompt)&#10;&#10;    def execute_task(self, task, context, max_retries=3):&#10;        plan = self.plan(task, context)&#10;        code = context&#10;        for step in plan:&#10;            code = self.execute_step(step, code)&#10;            test_result = self.run_tests(code)&#10;            retries = 0&#10;            while not test_result.passed and retries &lt; max_retries:&#10;                code = self.fix_errors(code, test_result.error)&#10;                test_result = self.run_tests(code)&#10;                retries += 1&#10;        return code\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CodeAgent</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, llm, tools):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.llm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> llm</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tools </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tools</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> plan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, task_description, codebase_context):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"Task: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">task_description</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Context: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">codebase_context</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Create a step-by-step plan to implement this task.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.llm.generate(prompt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute_step</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, step, current_code):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"Step: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">step</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Current code:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">current_code</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Write the code to implement this step.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        new_code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.llm.generate(prompt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_code</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> run_tests</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, code):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.tools[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"test_runner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].run(code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> result</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> fix_errors</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, code, error_message):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"\"Code:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">code</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Error:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">error_message</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Fix the error and return the corrected code.\"\"\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.llm.generate(prompt)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> execute_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, task, context, max_retries</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        plan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.plan(task, context)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> step </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plan:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.execute_step(step, code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            test_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.run_tests(code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            retries </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            while</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> test_result.passed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> retries </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_retries:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                code </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.fix_errors(code, test_result.error)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                test_result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.run_tests(code)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                retries </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Agent 类型</th>\n<th>代表产品</th>\n<th>能力范围</th>\n<th>自主性</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>补全 Agent</td>\n<td>Copilot</td>\n<td>行/函数级</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>日常编码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对话 Agent</td>\n<td>ChatGPT/Claude</td>\n<td>文件级</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>功能实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务 Agent</td>\n<td>Devin/Claude Code</td>\n<td>项目级</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>独立任务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>审查 Agent</td>\n<td>CodeRabbit</td>\n<td>代码审查</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>PR 审查</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>代码 Agent 的核心挑战是可靠性。在简单任务上，Agent 可以端到端地完成工作；但在复杂任务上，错误会在规划、实现和调试的循环中累积。当前最有效的人机协作模式是&quot;AI 起草，人类审查&quot;——Agent 完成初始实现，开发者审查并修正，Agent 再根据反馈优化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"代码质量保障与测试生成\">代码质量保障与测试生成</h2><p>AI 代码生成的质量保障是工程落地的关键环节。生成的代码可能存在功能性错误、安全漏洞、性能问题和风格不一致等问题。自动化测试生成是 AI 辅助质量保障的核心能力——如果 AI 能够同时生成代码和测试，就能在一定程度上自我验证。</p>\n<p>AI 生成代码的常见质量问题包括：幻觉 API（调用不存在的函数或方法）、上下文不一致（使用错误的变量名或类型）、安全隐患（SQL 注入、路径遍历）和过度复杂（生成不必要的抽象层）。建立系统性的质量检查流程——类型检查、静态分析、单元测试和安全扫描——是确保生成代码可靠性的必要手段。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>质量维度</th>\n<th>检查方法</th>\n<th>自动化工具</th>\n<th>典型问题</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>语法正确性</td>\n<td>编译/解析</td>\n<td>编译器</td>\n<td>语法错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类型安全</td>\n<td>类型检查</td>\n<td>TypeScript/mypy</td>\n<td>类型不匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>功能正确性</td>\n<td>单元测试</td>\n<td>pytest/vitest</td>\n<td>逻辑错误</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>安全性</td>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td>Semgrep/CodeQL</td>\n<td>注入/泄露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>代码风格</td>\n<td>Linter</td>\n<td>ESLint/Biome</td>\n<td>风格不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>性能</td>\n<td>基准测试</td>\n<td>Benchmark 框架</td>\n<td>性能退化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"mindmap\" data-source=\"mindmap&#10;  root((代码生成))&#10;    代码补全&#10;      行级/函数级&#10;      FIM 中间填充&#10;      项目级上下文&#10;    代码 Agent&#10;      任务规划&#10;      自主执行&#10;      迭代修复&#10;    质量保障&#10;      自动测试&#10;      类型检查&#10;      安全扫描&#10;    演进趋势&#10;      从补全到 Agent&#10;      人机协作&#10;      可靠性提升\">mindmap\n  root((代码生成))\n    代码补全\n      行级/函数级\n      FIM 中间填充\n      项目级上下文\n    代码 Agent\n      任务规划\n      自主执行\n      迭代修复\n    质量保障\n      自动测试\n      类型检查\n      安全扫描\n    演进趋势\n      从补全到 Agent\n      人机协作\n      可靠性提升</pre><ul>\n<li>代码补全是使用频率最高的 AI 编程能力，FIM 训练使模型支持中间位置的补全</li>\n<li>代码 Agent 将 AI 从被动补全升级为主动的任务执行者，自主规划和实现功能</li>\n<li>上下文窗口大小和 RAG 检索直接影响代码生成的质量和项目适配性</li>\n<li>自动化测试生成和多维度质量检查是确保 AI 生成代码可靠性的必要环节</li>\n<li>当前最有效的模式是&quot;AI 起草，人类审查&quot;的人机协作工作流</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"代码生成","id":"代码生成"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"代码补全与上下文理解","id":"代码补全与上下文理解"},{"level":2,"text":"代码 Agent 与自动化开发","id":"代码-agent-与自动化开发"},{"level":2,"text":"代码质量保障与测试生成","id":"代码质量保障与测试生成"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"创意 AI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/creative-ai"},"next":{"title":"内容生产管线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/generative-ai/aigc-applications/content-pipeline"}}